{
  "info": {
    "name": "StrataOS External API v1 \u2014 Performance & Smoke",
    "_postman_id": "strataos-external-api-v1-perf",
    "description": "Partner-facing External API v1 (/api/v1). Auth is via the X-API-Key header \u2014 create a key through the JWT-authenticated POST /api/v1/api-keys management endpoint. Every request asserts an HTTP status and a per-endpoint response-time budget, so this collection doubles as a newman smoke/perf check:\n\n  newman run strataos_external_api_v1.postman_collection.json \\\n    -e strataos_external_api_v1.postman_environment.json --iteration-count 20\n\nThe k6 equivalent is tests/performance/external_api_benchmark.ts. Writes are append-only and must target a demo/staging building.",
